        "TileImage": "$($repository 671746f4-eecd-417d-b0cd-1ad49e88f0c2).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47! Your targets are Catalina Delgado, wife of famous Colombian drug kingpin Rico Delgado, and her crush, Paul Powers. A secret affair has been brewing between the two for quite some time, and now Paul finally had a reason to come visit Catalina. A contract has been placed both on the wife&apos;s head, and also on Paul&apos;s so this is a perfect chance to carry out a double-contract and hit two birds with one stone. \rThis will also have a positive effect on US-Colombian relations. Happy hunting 47!",
